UID: ARCH-DEP-001
STATUS: Accepted
TITLE: Enforced dependency direction
STATEMENT: >>>
CMake target dependencies shall remain acyclic and prevent core model, DAE, and linear-algebra libraries from depending on parsers, concrete solver adapters, GUI code, or .NET host components.
<<<
