STATEMENT: >>>
Engine instances shall construct device registries, model loaders, and solver factories explicitly with no mutable process-global circuit state. CPU-only builds shall require no GPU drivers, MPI, or Trilinos.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Verification: Build and run the CPU package on a no-GPU machine and execute concurrent engine instances with distinct registries.
<<<
