STATEMENT: >>>
Linear backends shall declare supported scalar types (real64/complex64), index widths, symbolic reuse, numeric refactorization, and transpose solves, and reject unsupported combinations before execution. SuiteSparse KLU shall serve as the primary CPU sparse direct solver for general unsymmetric circuit matrices.
