CLI, C ABI, .NET SDK, StarLark-cs, and schematic UI clients shall construct the same validated Canonical IR and receive consistent capabilities, structured diagnostics, and typed result manifests.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Verification: Run identical circuits through CLI, C# SDK, StarLark-cs, and schematic IR emission and assert matching results.
<<<
