Spice.Sdk shall provide a thin external-process XyceBackend implementing ISimulationBackend over the Canonical IR so real circuits run immediately and act as a differential oracle for NativeCppBackend without introducing GPLv3 or Trilinos dependencies into the C++20 core or .NET SDK.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Verification: Execute the same Canonical IR circuit on XyceBackend (external prebuilt binary) and NativeCppBackend and compare typed results; inspect build graphs to verify zero link-time Xyce dependency.
