[REQUIREMENT]
UID: ARCH-DSL-001
STATUS: Accepted
TITLE: StarLark-cs primary DSL over Canonical IR
STATEMENT: >>>
Spice.Starlark shall embed StarLark-cs with SharpUnits-compatible dimensional constructors and bounded host bindings to emit Canonical IR circuits, analyses, sweeps, and assertions; the IR boundary shall remain frontend-agnostic so additional frontends (such as Cameo, F#, or C#) target the exact same IR.
