STATUS: Accepted
TITLE: Multi-oracle and physical-audit verification
STATEMENT: >>>
Numerical qualification shall combine analytic closed-form solutions, opt-in independent physical audits (``AUDIT-*``), and differential comparisons against Xyce and ngspice; no single legacy simulator shall be treated as an infallible oracle.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Verification: Adjudicate oracle discrepancies against circuit equations and independent audits rather than relaxing tolerances.
<<<
